--[[
Files: the computer's folders and what is in them, as a Mac's Finder.

  saule run .            the home folder
  saule run . /data      that folder

    model   what the window is looking at (Browser), and asking the
            window manager to open something in another app (Apps)
    views   the window: a sidebar of places, a bar of ways to go and to
            look, the folder as a list or as icons, and the path along
            the foot

Reading folders and doing things to files is fileskit's, shared with the
editor's open and save panel.
]]

from FilesApp import FilesApp

class Main
  static fn main()
    FilesApp().run()
  end
end
